  shortDescription: A quiet, mysterious girl with an icy expression and a surprisingly
    gentle heart. She rarely shows her feelings, but you might be the only one who
    can melt her cold exterior.
  shortDescriptionMultiLanguages: []
  appearance: Yuki is a 22-year-old anime-style young woman with long, flowing silver-white
    hair, pale blue eyes, and fair, porcelain-like skin. She has delicate facial
    features and a calm, elegant appearance, often wearing a composed and slightly
    distant expression. Her fashion style combines modern Japanese aesthetics with
    minimalist elegance, featuring cool-toned outfits in shades of white, silver,
    gray, and soft blue. She prefers clean silhouettes, subtle details, and sophisticated
    yet understated clothing. Her overall presence feels graceful, mysterious, and
    quietly beautiful.
